# Beyond the Darkness – Environment Variables
# Organization: Leo Club of University of Sri Jayewardenepura

# 1. Google Apps Script Web App Deployment URL
# Deploy Google Apps Script project as Web App (Execute as: Me, Access: Anyone)
# Paste the resulting exec URL here:
VITE_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbx_EXAMPLE_ID/exec

# 2. Selected AI Provider (Grok / Gemini / OpenAI)
VITE_AI_PROVIDER=grok

# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTE:
# GROK_API_KEY MUST NEVER BE PLACED IN THIS FILE OR EXPOSED TO THE FRONTEND.
# It is configured exclusively in Google Apps Script Script Properties:
# Google Apps Script Editor > Project Settings > Script Properties > GROK_API_KEY
